('110.3.b.7.E',2,'While reading, a child writes one word on a sticky note about each page. This is...','["a spelling test", "interacting with the text", "a joke", "losing the book"]'::jsonb,1,'Writing on notes is interacting.','original'),
('110.3.b.7.F',2,'You learned the word "gigantic." Which sentence uses it right?','["Gigantic is a color.", "I gigantic my lunch.", "The whale is gigantic.", "The mouse is gigantic and small."]'::jsonb,2,'It means huge.','original'),
('110.3.b.11.D.x',2,'Which spelling is right for a person you like and play with?','["freind", "frend", "frind", "friend"]'::jsonb,3,'Friend has ie.','original'),
